    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A monster plant that has grown by absorbing the poison in the Sea of Spores. It is a follower of Orfen, the Ruler of the Sea of Spores. It was given a task by Orfen to kill trespassing humans. Ivory Tower mystics are sent to tend to the magic force field that prevents spores from spreading, but many have been slain by the Rotting Tree. Plants Lv. 5 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Plants. HP Recovery +10% Resistance to Poison +20% Resistance to Knockback +20% Resistance to Fist +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Fire -10% Resistance to Spear -10% Holy Vulnerability Lv. 2 Vulnerable to Divinity attack. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
